WHAT THIS REPOSITORY IS

A portfolio record. It documents how an automation system was designed, what it
was built to prevent, and how it behaves when something fails. It is written to
be read.

WHAT YOU MAY DO

Read it. Link to it. Quote a short passage with attribution. Show it to a
colleague. That is what it is published for.

WHAT IS NOT PERMITTED

Copying, reproducing, republishing, modifying or redistributing the contents
of this repository in whole or in substantial part, or presenting this work
as your own.

The systems described here were designed and built in full by the copyright
holder, to briefs that real businesses published in their own words. The
implementations — the workflow graphs, the execution order, the prompts, the
thresholds and the integration wiring — are not published here and are not
licensed to anyone.

